     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "The first mountain for every Seeker to conquer!",
       "transl": "Перша гора, яку має підкорити кожен Шукач!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.guild-leader",
       "expression": "DETERMINED"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "PROUD"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "And it's filled with cute little frog-bunnies.",
       "transl": "І вона переповнена милими жабо-зайцями."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "antagonists.sidekick",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I still feel bad about beating up so many of them...",
       "transl": "Мені й досі шкода, що довелося стільки їх побити..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "antagonists.sidekick",
       "expression": "AWWW"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Now, now, Joern. ",
       "transl": "Ну-ну, Йорне."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.guild-leader",
       "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "These little bunnies might seem cute, but they can cause quite a lot of havoc as well.",
       "transl": "Ці маленькі зайчики можуть здаватися милими, але вони також здатні наробити чимало лиха."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.guild-leader",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Have you heard of the \\c[3]Great Frobbit Plague\\c[0]?",
       "transl": "Чи чули ви про \\c[3]Велику Жаячу Чуму\\c[0]?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.guild-leader",
       "expression": "DETERMINED"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "How?!",
       "transl": "Як?!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SHOCKED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Urgh...",
       "transl": "Уфф..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "antagonists.sidekick",
       "expression": "ANGRY"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "That is some history I do NOT want to hear.\\. Thank you.",
       "transl": "Це одна із тих історій, яких я НЕ хотів би чути.\\. Дякую."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "antagonists.sidekick",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "I only wanted her to remember.\\.\nRemember what happened.\\.\nTell me where I could find them.",
